@Shipping.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### Create a new shipment
POST {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quoteId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "customerId": "987fcdeb-51a2-43d7-890a-123456789abc",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "deviceType": "Smartphone",
  "deviceBrand": "Apple",
  "deviceModel": "iPhone 14 Pro",
  "quoteValue": 850.00
}

###

### Get shipment by ID (replace {{shipmentId}} with actual ID from create response)
GET {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### Get shipment by tracking number
GET {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/tracking/1Z123456789012345

###

### Generate shipping label (replace {{shipmentId}} with actual ID)
POST {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/generate-label

###

### Update tracking information (replace {{shipmentId}} with actual ID)
POST {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/tracking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_transit",
  "statusDescription": "Package is in transit",
  "location": "Chicago, IL Distribution Center",
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2024-12-25T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### Mark as delivered (replace {{shipmentId}} with actual ID)
POST {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveredTo": "John Doe",
  "deliveryLocation": "Front door"
}

###

### Cancel shipment (replace {{shipmentId}} with actual ID)
POST {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer cancelled order"
}

###

### Get customer shipments
GET {{Shipping.API_HostAddress}}/customers/987fcdeb-51a2-43d7-890a-123456789abc/shipments

###
